$ LIBRARY/CREATE/HELP H90D H90D
$ LIBRARY/CREATE/HELP H90Y DEEPER
$ MACRO/DEBUG DBGT
$ LINK/DEBUG DBGT
$ LIBRARY/EXTRACT=*/OUTPUT=SYS$OUTPUT/HELP H90Y
